WEBVTT

00:16:58.337 --> 00:17:00.542
I don't think I changed that much.

00:17:00.566 --> 00:17:03.126
I think I'm the same sane person.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:04.321
BS: (Laughs)

00:17:04.345 --> 00:17:05.903
I said what I want to say

00:17:05.927 --> 00:17:10.469
and, for the most part,
I do what I want to do.

00:17:11.065 --> 00:17:13.129
I think you have to be a force for good --

00:17:13.153 --> 00:17:14.312
BS: Yeah. Yeah.

00:17:14.336 --> 00:17:16.872
JL: ... to inspire people,
to encourage people.

00:17:16.896 --> 00:17:23.288
BS: I was so moved when you organized
the protests around gun violence,

00:17:23.312 --> 00:17:27.917
and I'm wondering how you think
we should be teaching people

00:17:27.941 --> 00:17:29.607
what it means to be hopeful.

00:17:29.631 --> 00:17:32.047
How do you think about communicating that